### Initialization ###
units si
atom_style molecular
dimension 3
boundary p p p
newton on

### System definition ###
variable L equal 7.5e-7
region simbox block 0.0 ${L} 0.0 ${L} 0.0 ${L}
create_box 1 simbox &
            bond/types 1 &
            extra/bond/per/atom 1 &
            extra/special/per/atom 2

mass 1 1.67372e-27
molecule h2 h2.mol
create_atoms 0 random 20000 42 simbox &
              mol h2 24680 &
              overlap 2.0e-10 &
              maxtry 500

### Force field ###
pair_style lj/cut 1.0e-9
pair_coeff 1 1 1.056e-21 2.827e-10
special_bonds lj 0.0 0.0 0.0
bond_style zero
bond_coeff 1 7.4e-11

### Group + chunks per molecule ###
group h2gas type 1
compute molchunk h2gas chunk/atom molecule
# T_internal: COM motion of each molecule subtracted, leaving rotational DOF.
# adof=3 (3 velocity components per atom), cdof=3 (subtract 3 COM DOF per chunk).
compute Tchunk  h2gas temp/chunk molchunk com yes adof 3.0 cdof 3.0
compute Ttrans  all temp/com                       # translational T (COM)

### Initial velocities ###
velocity all create 300.0 482748 mom yes rot no dist gaussian

### Neighbor list ###
neighbor        1.0e-7 bin
neigh_modify    delay 0 every 20 check yes
atom_modify     sort 0 0.0

### Time integration: keep H2 rigid so vibration is removed ###
fix myintegrator all rigid/small molecule

### Thermo ###
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step c_Ttrans c_Tchunk press pe ke etotal
thermo_modify lost warn

timestep 1.0e-15
run      10000
